<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>403 禁止访问</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Inter','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif}
body{width:100%;height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f1626 0%,#2a3b4c 100%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.logo-container{margin-bottom:30px;text-align:center}
.logo{width:350px;height:120px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff00;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:32px;color:#fff;font-weight:bold}
.error-container{text-align:center;max-width:600px;width:100%}
.error-code{font-size:140px;font-weight:800;color:#00a8ff;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:15px;text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,168,255,0.3)}
.error-title{font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:25px;font-weight:600}
.error-desc{font-size:18px;color:#b0c4de;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px}
.reason-list{list-style:none;color:#b0c4de;font-size:16px;line-height:2;margin:0 auto 40px;max-width:450px;text-align:left}
.reason-list li{position:relative;padding-left:24px}
.reason-list li::before{content:"•";color:#00a8ff;font-size:20px;position:absolute;left:0;top:-2px}
.btn-group{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:60px}
.btn{padding:14px 38px;border-radius:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s ease;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary{background:#00a8ff;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,168,255,0.3)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:#008ae6;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0,168,255,0.4);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#00a8ff;border:1px solid #00a8ff}
.btn-secondary:hover{background:rgba(0,168,255,0.1);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-tertiary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:#b0c4de}
.btn-tertiary:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.copyright{font-size:14px;color:#879ab6;position:absolute;bottom:30px}
@media (max-width:768px){
.error-code{font-size:100px}
.error-title{font-size:28px}
.logo{width:100px;height:100px;font-size:28px}
.btn{padding:12px 32px;font-size:16px}
}
@media (max-width:480px){
.error-code{font-size:80px}
.error-title{font-size:24px}
.error-desc{font-size:16px}
.btn-group{gap:15px}
.btn{width:100%;max-width:300px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="logo-container">
<div class="logo"></div>
<img src="https://www.yrdown.com/zb_users/upload/2026/01/202601101768008876692133.png" alt="优软下载" class="logo"> -->
</div>
<div class="error-container">
<div class="error-code">403</div>
<h1 class="error-title">禁止访问</h1>
<p class="error-desc">很抱歉，您没有权限访问该页面，请检查权限或联系管理员</p>
<ul class="reason-list">
<li>未登录或登录失效</li>
<li>账号无此页面访问权限</li>
<li>访问地址有误或资源已移除</li>
</ul>
<div class="btn-group">
<a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
<a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn btn-secondary">返回上一页</a>
<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-tertiary">联系客服</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="copyright">© 2024 优软下载 版权所有</div>
</body>
</html>